id: pm-jira-h5bm
title: Jira Cloud imports still call removed offset search endpoint
description: "The shared import path uses GET /rest/api/3/search with startAt and total. Jira Cloud now requires /rest/api/3/search/jql with nextPageToken and isLast. Migrate sync and both importers together, reject malformed or cycling pagination before writes, and report progress without a fabricated total."
type: Issue
status: blocked
priority: 1
tags[3]: correctness,jira,pagination
created_at: "2026-09-29T21:32:52.063Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T23:48:54.782Z"
author: codex-jira-search
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Official Cloud request contract; real HTTPS cursor and failure regressions; no tracker writes after invalid page chains; exact CLI SDK 2026.9.29; full release gate and packed npm/Bun acceptance; current-head CI and reviews; live Jira acceptance remains explicit if credentials unavailable.
repro_steps: Inspect dry-run URL and exercise a Cloud-shaped two-page response without total.
expected_result: Fetch each cursor page once from search/jql before importing.
actual_result: Requests the removed endpoint and expects offset pagination.
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-02T23:20:52.286Z",codex-sol-land,"Resumed PR #120 from 98beb9367115f40836576827a614c515be58c604. Rebase onto current fix/pm-jira-cli-2026-09-27-github-pin yields 16c988b50224d7503ee50a4a5759982c531b3d46. All existing bot artifacts and restart-era owner replies inspected; no new actionable finding. Preserve earlier fixes and technical refusals. Verifying unchanged CI gates under the shared heavy lock; no merge, release or closure."
  "2026-10-02T23:21:49.233Z",codex-sol-land,"Resumed verification: npm ci, current-base rebase, fresh committed-dist comparison, strict local tracker health with required merge drivers, npm run release:check, and bun install --no-save all passed. Full gate: 193 tests, 193 pass, 0 skips; configured coverage thresholds unchanged. PM-linked test/release-workflow.test.ts passed. Earlier findings and technical refusals retained; no new source fix was needed in this restart. Exact pushed-head CI and substantive reviewer availability remain separate checks; no merge, release, publication or item closure."
  "2026-10-02T23:38:49.062Z",codex-sol-land,"Accepted Greptile 4170642491: the restart linked a publication-workflow check as focused Jira repair evidence. Removed only that new test/file link, preserving all historical notes and history events. Use the already-linked real Cloud search/TLS regression instead. Parent #119 is refreshed to 2961c67 with the verified npm-runner refusal; rebase is clean. Full unchanged release gate will rerun on this stack."
  "2026-10-02T23:48:52.417Z",codex-sol-land,"Delta from the earlier verification receipt: removed the unrelated publication-workflow test/file link accepted in Greptile 4170642491; the original Cloud search/TLS regression remains linked and is now the focused evidence. Rebased onto final parent 78caa84 after its metadata-only review correction. No Jira runtime/dependency change was needed. New full release:check verification passes: 193 tests, 193 pass, 0 skips; PM-linked test/cloud-search.test.ts, strict health, fresh dist equality and Bun install pass with unchanged gates. Exact-head CI/reviews and prior broader blockers remain separate."
notes[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-29T21:37:07.216Z",codex-jira-search,"Red-first regression: Cloud dry-run expected /rest/api/3/search/jql but returned removed /rest/api/3/search. New tests use real local TLS with a generated certificate and actual PM atomic transactions, including opaque cursors, empty intermediate pages, bounded traversal and refusal without writes. Source reference: https://developer.atlassian.com/cloud/jira/platform/rest/v3/api-group-issue-search/ . No live Jira credential or hosted user data is used."
  "2026-09-29T21:39:14.964Z",codex-jira-search,"The real HTTPS test also exposed empty atomic imports being sent to commitItemMutations, which correctly refuses zero mutations. The package now treats an empty import as successful without a transaction. Full release:check passed 193 tests with zero skips and 100 percent lines/branches/functions on its two measured runtime files; npm audit reports zero vulnerabilities. All-source/four-dimension/documentation gaps are tracked separately in pm-jira-gpjr. Published CLI SDK 2026.9.29 resolves prior host/extension skew. pm-github dry-run finds zero open source issues."
  "2026-09-29T21:40:36.749Z",codex-jira-search,"Packed artifact acceptance passed in separate npm/npx and Bun/bunx projects with CLI 2026.9.29: fresh PM initialization, merge-driver installation, tarball extension installation, Cloud dry-run URL assertions and strict health all succeeded. The package is not published or deployed. This branch is based on the existing certification PR #119 and preserves that work and its ownership. Live authenticated Jira acceptance and complete bot review are still required."
  "2026-09-29T21:42:31.859Z",codex-jira-search,"Linked HTTPS acceptance passed in an isolated source snapshot with pm_context_mode=none, 19 tests and zero skips. An earlier accidental full release run in snapshot mode failed four Git-dependent checks because snapshots do not contain repository metadata; that failure is retained and is not a core CLI defect. The full gate passed directly in the real checkout. Review and actual Jira tenant acceptance remain open."
  "2026-09-29T21:54:50.626Z",codex-jira-search,"Review round one: Greptile finding 4138693215 about external OpenSSL is valid, upvoted and answered inline. Replaced certificate generation with declared selfsigned 5.5.0 using inspected installed types and native crypto; the full 193-test release gate passes and the real HTTPS suite passes 19/19 with PATH pointing at an empty directory. TLS verification remains enabled and no private key fixture is stored. Added module and runImport documentation for the embedded CodeRabbit docstring warning. CodeRabbit first-head review had no inline correctness findings; Sourcery and cubic quotas and silent Gemini are missing reviews, not approval."
  "2026-09-29T21:59:40.237Z",codex-jira-search,"Runtime distinction: default bunx packed acceptance passes but can honor the Node shebang. A stronger fresh install using bunx --bun for every CLI step passes initialization, extension installation and Jira Cloud dry-run, but strict health fails merge_driver_configuration_drift:5. The failure persists with --no-extensions, independently confirming existing open upstream pm-cli#1349 rather than a Jira defect. Do not call native Bun strict health green or duplicate that upstream issue. npm/npx strict health remains green."
